'''Beastite''' (Japanese: '''ビーストナイト''' ''Beastnite'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=Attacks used by the {{TCGP|Ultra Beast}} this card is attached to do +10 damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon for each point you have gotten.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Beastite}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Beastite|185}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*This card's effect is based on {{a|Beast Boost}}, an Ability common to all Ultra Beasts in the games that raises the user's highest stat (including Attack or Special Attack) when they Knock Out an opponent.

